keiko 1
# K3 (verified offline blocking) — the write precedes the check, and an
# unreachable verdict leaves the row Set but not checked rather than Invalid.
# Excluded: the transient Checking frame (k3b), the resolver rebuild and the
# absence of a live validity claim, the network block's own verification.
fault key-check unreachable
setting play.text_speed 0

activate title.settings
activate settings.key
type "sk-nano-0123456789abcdef"
press Enter
expect surface settings
expect control settings.key label "Set — sk-nano-…cdef · not checked (see the log)"
